As I've been traveling lately,
I've been thinking about things.{VAR BE01}
Things like what I can do with my life,
and what I want to do, but...{VAR BE01}
I'm thinking how cool it would be
to be a model like Elesa.{VAR BE01}
And then, how cool it would be to do
research on Pokémon like{VAR BE00}
Professor Juniper...{VAR BE01}
If that's what I want to do, I'm gonna
have to know a lot about Pokémon.{VAR BE00}
Sooooo...would you please battle me?{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Yep!
{VAR 0100 0000}, you're amazing!{VAR BE01}
I'm really, really, really impressed, and
that makes me want to give this to you!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: In Castelia City, my precious
Pokémon was stolen by Team Plasma.{VAR BE01}
So I really, really understand!{VAR BE01}
If Team Plasma forces everyone to
liberate their Pokémon,{VAR BE00}
there will be nothing but sad people!{VAR BE01}
{VAR 0100 0000}!
Stop Team Plasma!{VAR BE01}
Don't allow Pokémon to be stolen
from Trainers who love them!{VAR BE01}
I think that's the truth--or ideal--that
you've been pursuing, {VAR 0100 0000}...{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Oh dear, here I've come all this
way, and I'm afraid I'm bothering you{VAR BE00}
when you're going through so much.{VAR BE01}
